        "@id": "https://ubuntu.com/security/notices/USN-4442-1",
        "name": "USN-4442-1",
        "description": "Michael Kaczmarczik discovered that Sympa incorrectly handled HTTP GET/POST requests. An attacker could possibly use this issue to insert, edit or obtain sensitive information. (CVE-2018-1000550)  It was discovered that Sympa incorrectly handled URL parameters. An attacker could possibly use this issue to perform XSS attacks. (CVE-2018-1000671)  Nicolas Chatelain discovered that Sympa incorrectly handled environment variables. An attacker could possibly use this issue with a setuid binary and gain root privileges. (CVE-2020-10936)",
        "aliases": [
          "CVE-2018-1000550",
          "CVE-2018-1000671",
          "CVE-2020-10936"
        ]
      },
